{"words": [{"text": "مَثَلُهُمْ", "translation": "Their example"}, {"text": "كَمَثَلِ", "translation": "(is) like (the) example"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "(of) the one who"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَوْقَدَ", "translation": "kindled"}, {"text": "نَارًۭا", "translation": "a fire"}, {"text": "فَلَمَّآ", "translation": "then, when"}, {"text": "أَضَآءَتْ", "translation": "it illuminated"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "حَوْلَهُۥ", "translation": "(was) around him"}, {"text": "ذَهَبَ", "translation": "took away"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بِنُورِهِمْ", "translation": "their light"}, {"text": "وَتَرَكَهُمْ", "translation": "and left them"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ظُلُمَـٰتٍۢ", "translation": "darkness[es]"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "(so) not"}, {"text": "يُبْصِرُونَ", "translation": "(do) they see"}], "sahih": "Their example is that of one who kindled a fire, but when it illuminated what was around him, Allāh took away their light and left them in darkness [so] they could not see."}